#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Fail-closed local primitives for Codex team routing.

The CLI validates contracts, prepares a single dispatch for the active Codex
agent, maintains local audit evidence, and binds verified runtime endpoints.
It never calls a provider API itself: the active agent must use the Codex app
message tool with the exact prepared target and prompt, then record its receipt.
"""

